    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of Proceeds: We will not receive any proceeds from the sale of Common Shares by the Selling Shareholders. See \u201cUse of Proceeds.\u201d Risk Factors: See \u201cRisk Factors\u201d and other information included in this prospectus for a discussion of risk factors you should carefully consider before deciding to invest in our Common Shares. Timing of Sales: No sales of the Common Shares covered by this Resale Prospectus shall occur until the Common Shares sold in the primary offering begin trading on the OTCQB.\u00a0There can be no assurance that our Common Shares will ever be quoted on the OTCQB or any stock exchange, or that any market for our Common Shares will develop. Alt-1 Table of Contents USE OF PROCEEDS We will not receive any of the proceeds from the sale of Common Shares by the Selling Shareholders. All net proceeds from the sale of Common Shares covered by this Resale Prospectus will go to the Se",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
